          %p
            This page collects introductory seminar notes to the concepts of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+%28Eilenberg-Steenrod%29+cohomology+theory"} generalized (Eilenberg-Steenrod) cohomology theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordism+theory"} cobordism theory
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+oriented+cohomology"} complex oriented cohomology
          %p
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \,
          %p
            %em
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
              of those
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+cohomology+theories"} generalized cohomology theories
              that are equipped with a universal “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+oriented+cohomology+theory"} complex
              = succeed "\u201D" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientation+in+generalized+cohomology"} orientation
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+theory"} stable homotopy theory
              with the concrete richness of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+topology"} differential topology
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordism+theory"} cobordism theory
              and of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/arithmetic+geometry"} arithmetic geometry
              of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+group+laws"} formal group laws
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+curves"} elliptic curves
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/chromatic+homotopy+theory"} chromatic homotopy theory
