          %p
            %strong Outline.
            We start with two classical topics of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
            that first run independently in parallel:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#S1GeneralizedCohomology"} 1) Generalized cohomology
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#S2CobordismTheory"} 2) Cobordism theory
          %p
            The development of either of these happens to give rise to the concept of
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectra"} spectra
            and via this concept it turns out that both topics are intimately related. The unification of both is our third topic
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#ComplexOrientedCohomologyTheory"} 3) Complex oriented cohomology
