                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \pi_n
              for
              = succeed "." do
                %strong all basepoints
            %p
              It is this last condition of testing on all basepoints that the assumed
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cogroup"} cogroup
              structure on the
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi S
                      %mi i
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S_i
              allows to do away with: this cogroup structure implies that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msub
                      %mi S
                      %mi i
                    %mo ,
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
