              (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-1#DiagramSpectra"}> here.
              ) to be more precise on this point, but the conclusion is the same) that for all
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi n
                      %mn 1
